2. **`blut/src/tui/system.rs`**: move `SystemSnapshot`+helpers to `broker/probe.rs` as `ResourceSnapshot` (pub); leave a re-export shim `pub use crate::broker::probe::ResourceSnapshot as SystemSnapshot;` so tui/mod.rs:236/293/554 unchanged. `gpu_summary()` stays.
